## Writing Decisions

**Python helpers:**
```python
from props_core.grader.helpers import insert_tp_match, insert_fp_match, insert_no_match

# TP match with full credit
insert_tp_match(session, grader_run_id,
    input_issue_id="dead-code-1",
    tp_id="tp-dead-utils",
    occurrence_id=1,
    found_credit=1.0,
    rationale="Exact match"
)

# FP match
insert_fp_match(session, grader_run_id,
    input_issue_id="dup-1",
    fp_id="fp-visual-consistency",
    rationale="This duplication is intentional for visual consistency"
)

# No match (novel issue)
insert_no_match(session, grader_run_id,
    input_issue_id="style-1",
    rationale="Style issue not in ground truth"
)
```
